### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:5050/api/health-db

### Register user (run once)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5050/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "minker",
  "password": "Init.1234"
}

### Login user
POST http://127.0.0.1:5050/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "minker",
  "password": "Init.1234"
}

### Copy returned token and paste it in the Authorization header below

### Who am I
GET http://127.0.0.1:5050/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN

### List events
GET http://127.0.0.1:5050/api/events
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN

### Create all-day event
POST http://127.0.0.1:5050/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN

{
  "title": "Local DB test event",
  "start_date": "2026-03-08",
  "end_date": "2026-03-08",
  "description": "Created via LOCAL_API_TESTS.http",
  "color_hex": "#0650f1"
}
